# Docker build context exclusions for the local development environment.
#
# Purpose: keep image builds fast and reproducible by excluding host-only
# artifacts (VCS metadata, IDE settings, build outputs, secrets) from the
# build contexts consumed by Docker Compose. Anything listed here is never
# uploaded to the Docker daemon nor baked into an image layer.
#
# Scope: applied globally to every build context under infra/docker/.
# Requirement 11.3: no host-only artifacts leak into the dev images.

**/.git
# DEFERRED: reactivar cuando se reintroduzca el Servicio_Frontend.
# **/node_modules
**/target
**/.env
**/.idea
**/.vscode
